notes.content:
1. Fixed a bug with the interface related to the Letter of Commendation;
2. Target Dummy (ability) no longer takes attack and health granted by the Altar of Quality of Life;
3. Text fixes (Chinese, English);

- Necromancers fixed;
- Mini-game in Hivesville is fixed;
- Some texts in Chinese and English localisation is fixed;
- The Archer's Monograph (book) now goes into the correct inventory tab. If you have a problem with this book, throw it away and pick it up again.

TIP: There is no quest in the game yet that leads to the item that weakens ghosts, but you can get it by bringing enough silver to the blacksmith in the Fortsville.
